  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Knowledge Platform for Security and Rule of Law</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Knowledge Platform Security &amp; Rule of Law (the Platform) aims to jointly explore innovative approaches to emerging challenges in the field of security and rule of law in fragile and conflict affected contexts.

It is a consortium programme led by the Clingendael Institute, in partnership with the International Development Law Organisation, and Saferworld, UK.</narrative>
  </description>
